O2CH2OCH2O2H+NO=>2CH2O+HO2+NO2    1.4E12 0.0 -7.15E2
! est CH3OO+NO=CH3O+NO2 (=) OCH2OCH2OOH+NO2 =) products)
!
CH3O+NH2=CH2O+NH3    3.0E13 0.0 0.0E0
!
CH2OH+NH2=CH2O+NH3    3.0E13 0.0 0.0E0
!
HCO+NH2=CO+NH3    3.0E13 0.0 0.0E0
