CH3+NH2=CH2NH+H2    4.8E11 -0.2 1.9403E4
    PLOG/1.0E-1 2.1E11 -1.0E-1 1.9095E4/
    PLOG/1.0E0 4.8E11 -2.0E-1 1.9403E4/
    PLOG/1.0E1 2.9E12 -4.0E-1 2.0506E4/
